                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "c368902b-a08f-4b3a-8524-96e44d9879d6",
                        "entry_id": "7384172d-3412-3e2b-abb7-171ad635bf8e",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "я́щерична"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f6c465f0-8064-47cf-9dcb-8f936c5a23f9",
                        "entry_id": "7384172d-3412-3e2b-abb7-171ad635bf8e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "я́щеричны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a96f67a-23ea-3168-9e36-3c93976576b2",
                        "entry_id": "7384172d-3412-3e2b-abb7-171ad635bf8e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным ящерица; свойственный, характерный для ящериц"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16ca79b7-0f90-40c7-927e-8fb6ef1a03a0",
                                "sense_id": "3a96f67a-23ea-3168-9e36-3c93976576b2",
                                "text": "Ремонт был увенчан окраской машины в ящеричный зелёный цвет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa7de2b6-2b10-42c2-bd7e-a25225a8588e",
                                "sense_id": "3a96f67a-23ea-3168-9e36-3c93976576b2",
                                "text": "Рыбьи, ящеричные предки человека оставили в его организме наслоения противоречивых физиологических устройств, и каждое из них обладало своими особенностями образования энтропических остатков жизнедеятельности."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9cc8c334-4cd5-38cd-aff9-03a064bacbba",
                        "entry_id": "7384172d-3412-3e2b-abb7-171ad635bf8e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "изготовленный из жира ящериц"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec04d8df-bbf1-4c81-aaeb-55d97501d218",
                                "sense_id": "9cc8c334-4cd5-38cd-aff9-03a064bacbba",
                                "text": "Жидкость для золочения приготовлялась из майского сока корней орешника, шафрана, бычачьей желчи, ласточкина помёта, серой амбры, жжёных медвежьих когтей и ящеричного масла."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d5432196-4c04-408f-a840-a2a516155465",
                        "source_entry_id": "7384172d-3412-3e2b-abb7-171ad635bf8e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lizard",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lizard",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any reptile of the order Squamata that is not a snake or part of Mosasauria — typically characterised by a rounded torso, a short neck with an elevated head, four limbs and a long tail, although some species are legless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acd71f7f-7a69-45a4-bca3-4d99b1a8efe6",
                                                "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                                "text": "The cicale above in the lime, / And the lizards below in the grass, / Were as silent as ever old Tmolus was, / Listening to my sweet pipings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5dadcd2-6507-4c2d-9d2d-7ce3f956af1c",
                                                "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                                "text": "The forms of the serpent and lizard exhibit almost every element of beauty and horror in strange combination; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03a7cab1-ae16-4d96-ab88-888607eb3731",
                                                "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                                "text": "Hooded rattlesnakes, horned toads, and lizards crawl in the dust and among the rocks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cedb541d-228f-4f10-b794-88e8afc84768",
                                                "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                                "text": "When held in the hand, the lizard produces an amorous stimulus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71b580a2-087d-45af-a513-faa012f2b81f",
                                                "sense_id": "bda4e827-d065-31d1-8f0a-30431b8a5aef",
                                                "text": "Pinned against my neighbours, I could feel small hands, fleeting as lizards, fluttering lightly through my pockets in search of money, mobile, wallet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "323b76fc-7c98-3eef-9957-2aaa1923b026",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lizard skin, the skin of these reptiles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb9de043-8722-480f-b197-6c0961b9ce41",
                                                "sense_id": "323b76fc-7c98-3eef-9957-2aaa1923b026",
                                                "text": "Silver bells jingling from your black lizard boots, my baby / Silver foil to trim your wedding gown"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6851e542-1c04-3c64-be66-5710da049266",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unctuous person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71065e84-6bcd-3f7a-92bc-9b0c158e1c1e",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A coward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6ff0652-0c71-3e4d-b62e-8df4f2b63f74",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hand forming a \\\"D\\\" shape with the tips of the thumb and index finger touching (a handshape resembling a lizard), that beats paper and Spock and loses to rock and scissors in rock-paper-scissors-lizard-Spock."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "837ec50e-a598-3bd8-9edb-33f984d6d0b8",
                                        "entry_id": "71a79529-4a96-3713-8fc1-f64447b02019",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who idly spends time in a specified place, especially a promiscuous female."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-compounds"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74a3ad06-93ca-4514-8964-9101e1acc6e7",
                                                "sense_id": "837ec50e-a598-3bd8-9edb-33f984d6d0b8",
                                                "text": "lounge lizard; lot lizard; beach lizard; truck stop lizard"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
